Title:  Window Reuse

Body:

Here's how the window reuse logic works. 

## WindowJuggler

The `WindowJuggler` class is used to keep track of windows, to ensure duplicates aren't opened. 

When the user requests to open a collection, the `findWindow(withURL: x)` method is called. If a window is returned, then that is used without opening a second window for the same collection. 

When the user closes a window, the `CollectionJuggler.windowClosing` method is called, which in turn calls the `WindowJuggler.windowClosing(withController: x)` method. 


